Package: rixcheck
Title: Continuous Reproducibility Checks for Nix-Based R Projects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Felipe", "Vieira", email = "felipelfv98@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scaffolds GitHub Actions workflows and Dockerfiles for projects
    whose computational environment is pinned with a Nix expression (for
    example one generated by the 'rix' package). The generated checks rebuild
    the pinned environment from its description, re-run the project's analysis
    and rendering steps, and optionally verify that committed outputs are
    still reproduced, upgrading the claim "this project is executable" to
    "this project still produces its published numbers from its recipe".
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
